WEBVTT

00:01.210 --> 00:07.090
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

00:01.210 --> 00:07.090
Starting  today,  I'll!!

00:02.000 --> 00:07.090
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

00:43.030 --> 00:44.660
Those omelettes look well made, Riko!

00:44.660 --> 00:46.700
I didn't do anything special.

00:46.700 --> 00:48.180
I could never make them that well.

00:48.180 --> 00:50.220
Guess you aren't ready to get married.

00:50.220 --> 00:51.580
Oh, stop!

00:52.140 --> 00:53.750
Hey, can I have one?

00:53.750 --> 00:54.890
Oh, sure.

00:55.630 --> 00:57.670
I'll trade one for a chicken nugget.

00:58.400 --> 00:58.690
Oink!

01:00.440 --> 01:02.400
Wh... What?!

01:05.360 --> 01:07.450
Three? What the heck are you doing?

01:07.450 --> 01:09.890
A pig's always hungry, so thanks!

01:09.890 --> 01:11.280
What just happened?

01:16.520 --> 01:18.210
Give me a bite.

01:25.030 --> 01:27.090
What the fuck?!

01:27.910 --> 01:29.430
I'm your friend, ain't I?

01:29.430 --> 01:30.390
My ass!

01:31.750 --> 01:33.390
Eat your own lunch, Mitsuhashi!

01:33.960 --> 01:35.640
I ate it in the morning!

01:35.640 --> 01:39.800
Come on, just give me a bite, Ryou!

01:38.300 --> 01:39.800
No!

01:39.800 --> 01:42.360
But we're friends, right?

01:41.260 --> 01:42.360
No, we're not!

01:50.930 --> 01:52.980
Okay, got it!

01:54.020 --> 01:55.660
Now, there! Gotcha!

01:56.610 --> 01:57.650
Dammit!

02:03.000 --> 02:03.880
Fuck!

02:06.530 --> 02:07.990
You know how late it is?

02:07.990 --> 02:10.470
Leave me alone, willya? Christ!

02:10.470 --> 02:13.680
A guy's gotta blow off steam sometimes.

02:16.080 --> 02:19.520
Say, are you being bullied at school?

02:20.170 --> 02:21.230
Me?

02:24.010 --> 02:26.140
Are you out of your freaking mind?!

02:27.220 --> 02:29.560
Do you even have any friends?

02:29.560 --> 02:31.850
God... I have too many to count!

02:31.850 --> 02:34.940
Maybe you just <i>think they're your friends.</i>

02:34.940 --> 02:35.910
What?

02:35.910 --> 02:37.270
Your address book.

02:37.270 --> 02:39.620
I found it in a pocket while doing laundry.

02:39.620 --> 02:41.650
It's completely blank!

02:43.290 --> 02:45.750
God, I thought I gave birth to a handsome boy.

02:46.910 --> 02:49.490
But your bad personality is even affecting your looks.

02:49.490 --> 02:51.720
So you have no friends, let alone a girlfriend?

02:51.720 --> 02:55.500
I guess you <i>do need video games to deal with that stress.</i>

02:55.500 --> 02:57.040
What the dick?

02:57.040 --> 03:01.000
She's the one with the looks to match her personality!

03:01.000 --> 03:03.190
How long are you gonna wear my goddamn jersey?!

03:03.190 --> 03:04.260
That's it!

03:04.260 --> 03:07.110
I'm gonna show her how wrong she really is!

03:07.270 --> 03:08.230
A

03:07.270 --> 03:13.160
Operation: Best Buds

03:18.650 --> 03:20.400
Hey! Going to work?

03:20.400 --> 03:20.940
Yeah.

03:20.940 --> 03:21.980
We'll drop by later.

03:21.980 --> 03:22.870
Okay, I'll be waiting.

03:22.870 --> 03:26.910
You guys need to stop fooling around and learn how to—

03:27.660 --> 03:29.870
Oh, it's you, Tanigawa.

03:29.870 --> 03:31.920
You look thrilled, what's up?

03:31.920 --> 03:35.330
Do you call this "looking thrilled"?

03:36.040 --> 03:37.370
Thank God I found you.

03:37.370 --> 03:40.080
I'm about to run into some trouble.

03:40.080 --> 03:42.290
Can you help me out, Imai?

03:42.290 --> 03:45.840
Tanigawa, Misako is the real issue at hand.

03:45.840 --> 03:48.440
We're conducting a strategy session on what to do about her next.

03:48.970 --> 03:50.720
If you got any good ideas, let me know.

03:50.720 --> 03:52.220
I'll be seeing you later.

03:57.480 --> 04:00.370
He completely blew me off.

04:21.500 --> 04:22.710
What's wrong?!

04:23.390 --> 04:23.980
Are you all right?

04:29.900 --> 04:31.930
Should I call an ambulance?

04:31.930 --> 04:35.390
H-He'll catch me before they arrive.

04:35.860 --> 04:38.450
Please, leave me here.

04:38.450 --> 04:40.310
B-But...

04:40.310 --> 04:41.620
Here, grab on!

04:45.270 --> 04:47.320
Sorry for having you do this.

04:47.320 --> 04:49.190
Don't be. It's no problem at all.

04:49.190 --> 04:50.710
Hey, can I have your name?

04:50.710 --> 04:52.000
Hold up!

04:54.580 --> 04:59.380
You think you can quit our gang that easy, Ryouko?

04:59.380 --> 05:02.260
God! Can't you let old bygones be bygones, Maejima?!

05:02.260 --> 05:05.340
I don't care if it's in the past; it's still written in stone!

05:05.340 --> 05:06.310
Now come with me!

05:07.460 --> 05:09.090
Stop it, you jerk!

05:09.090 --> 05:11.060
Huh, what's your problem?

05:11.060 --> 05:13.930
Drop it, kid! Please just go!

05:13.930 --> 05:14.970
No way!

05:14.970 --> 05:20.030
I'm not the type of trash who leaves an injured girl to some jerk like him!

05:21.270 --> 05:24.490
Hey, jerkoff! If you want to fight, I'm your guy!

05:25.060 --> 05:26.960
Wow, that's hot.

05:28.160 --> 05:29.690
All right, I'm game.

05:29.690 --> 05:32.540
If you beat me, I'll let that bitch go.

05:32.540 --> 05:37.010
My Akasaka fighting technique will never lose to a jerkoff like you!

05:38.590 --> 05:40.430
Let's do this!

05:47.000 --> 05:49.020
Stop it! Let me go!

05:48.210 --> 05:50.380
Shut up and c'mere!

05:50.380 --> 05:50.980
Let me go!

05:50.980 --> 05:51.630
C'mon!

05:51.630 --> 05:52.940
Let me... go!

05:53.800 --> 05:58.060
Hey, jerkoff! You better back off on the count of five!

05:58.060 --> 05:59.200
If not—

06:01.180 --> 06:02.370
One...

06:03.700 --> 06:07.330
So, shorty... the count of five, was it?

06:06.440 --> 06:07.330
Don't!

06:07.330 --> 06:08.160
Shaddap!

06:08.900 --> 06:10.120
Two...

06:11.110 --> 06:12.080
C'mon, punk!

06:12.080 --> 06:13.590
Get away!

06:14.910 --> 06:15.880
Three...

06:18.050 --> 06:19.300
Four...

06:19.300 --> 06:20.220
Five!

06:24.100 --> 06:25.260
What the?

06:36.110 --> 06:37.850
What?

06:39.600 --> 06:40.200
You did it!

06:41.350 --> 06:42.980
That was amazing!

06:42.980 --> 06:44.320
You took out a biker gang leader!

06:45.690 --> 06:47.790
A biker gang leader?

06:47.790 --> 06:49.440
He doesn't let go of grudges easily,

06:49.440 --> 06:51.250
so he might come after you.

06:51.250 --> 06:52.780
Right.

06:52.780 --> 06:54.580
So tell me your name.

06:55.070 --> 06:56.360
Tanaka Ryou.

06:56.360 --> 06:58.050
I'm Ryouko.

07:00.760 --> 07:03.830
Here, I also wrote down my address.

07:03.830 --> 07:04.720
Thanks.

07:05.210 --> 07:06.370
I'll call you.

07:06.370 --> 07:07.420
Okay.

07:07.420 --> 07:08.830
Take care of that leg.

07:08.830 --> 07:09.710
Thank you.

07:19.260 --> 07:21.220
"I'll call you."

07:22.220 --> 07:24.480
I saw the whole thing!

07:33.570 --> 07:36.200
Didn't know you had game, Ryou!

07:36.200 --> 07:38.570
O-Oh, she means nothing! We just—

07:38.570 --> 07:40.240
No need to explain nothing.

07:40.240 --> 07:41.870
Besides, I got a favor to ask.

07:41.870 --> 07:43.040
What is it?

07:45.680 --> 07:48.560
Can you write down your name and number here?

07:53.090 --> 07:54.520
I also have a favor to ask.

07:54.520 --> 07:57.470
Oh, lay it on me then.

07:57.470 --> 07:59.980
You're my boy, after all.

07:59.980 --> 08:01.940
Okay, here you go.

08:01.940 --> 08:03.970
Oh! Thank you! Thank you!

08:03.970 --> 08:06.230
That makes one. See ya!

08:06.230 --> 08:07.450
Ah, Mitsuhashi!

08:07.450 --> 08:08.910
What now?

08:10.150 --> 08:11.190
Oh, right!

08:11.190 --> 08:13.870
You need to win against a guy twice your size.

08:14.400 --> 08:18.240
There probably isn't a good way to do it anyway.

08:18.240 --> 08:20.590
Come on, it's frickin' easy!

08:20.590 --> 08:26.040
You hide yourself in a high place, then dropkick him from behind!

08:26.040 --> 08:27.930
But that's fighting dirty!

08:27.040 --> 08:27.930
Look here!

08:28.460 --> 08:32.390
What's a little cheating if you're
protecting someone dear to you?

08:35.630 --> 08:38.590
If anything happens, I'll be right there.

08:38.590 --> 08:40.900
We're friends, right?

08:40.900 --> 08:42.110
Bye, good luck!

08:44.220 --> 08:45.810
Mitsuhashi...

08:45.810 --> 08:48.030
He's a pretty cool guy!

08:59.210 --> 09:01.570
Tanaka Ryou!

09:11.370 --> 09:12.220
How did you...

09:12.220 --> 09:15.130
I know where Ryouko lives!

09:30.730 --> 09:32.410
Ryou's in danger.

09:40.530 --> 09:43.200
I must <i>always be the alpha male in everything.</i>

09:43.200 --> 09:46.420
I'm gonna make that crystal clear to you—

09:47.160 --> 09:47.910
Huh?

09:50.200 --> 09:51.540
Where didja go?

09:53.000 --> 09:54.260
Hey, shorty!

09:54.260 --> 09:56.790
Quit fucking hiding, goddammit!

09:56.790 --> 09:58.230
Get out here, shorty!

09:58.230 --> 10:00.510
I know where you fucking live!

10:00.510 --> 10:03.190
There's no use running, so get out here!

10:04.890 --> 10:09.150
What's a little cheating if you're
protecting someone dear to you?

10:15.650 --> 10:16.450
Ryou!

10:29.740 --> 10:31.500
I-I did it.

10:34.620 --> 10:36.430
R-Ryouko!

10:38.170 --> 10:39.390
He had his back turned...

10:39.960 --> 10:42.350
I... I was just...

10:44.340 --> 10:45.570
Oh me, oh my!

10:47.930 --> 10:49.550
You actually did it!

10:49.550 --> 10:51.220
You really <i>are a rat sneak!</i>

10:51.220 --> 10:52.730
And she dumped your ass.

10:54.180 --> 10:54.780
Rat sneak!

10:55.310 --> 10:57.620
Mitsuhashi! You're not my friend!

10:57.620 --> 10:58.870
Tanaka Ryou

10:58.150 --> 10:59.560
Fine by me.

10:59.560 --> 11:03.080
I already got your name and number!

11:05.110 --> 11:06.540
I-I don't believe you!

11:07.810 --> 11:07.950
WAS TRUSTING MITSUHASHI THE RIGHT THING TO DO?

11:13.090 --> 11:14.810
HELL
NO!!

11:15.730 --> 11:17.760
So I finally got one.

11:18.250 --> 11:21.340
It ain't easy filling out this thing.

11:24.340 --> 11:27.050
They're not people I can handle on my own.

11:27.050 --> 11:28.320
Yo! Tanigawa!

11:28.890 --> 11:31.180
Dang, what the heck's eating you?

11:31.180 --> 11:32.220
Lost your wallet?

11:32.220 --> 11:33.350
N-No...

11:33.350 --> 11:36.100
If something's on your mind, maybe I can help you, huh?

11:38.230 --> 11:39.650
Come on, you can tell me.

11:42.190 --> 11:42.900
Actually...

11:42.900 --> 11:43.290
Well?

11:43.980 --> 11:45.440
There are some knuckleheads

11:45.440 --> 11:48.110
who've been hanging around the neighborhood vending machines.

11:48.110 --> 11:51.280
Every time I pass them they hassle me for toll...

11:51.280 --> 11:53.450
What the hell? You should've told me sooner!

11:53.450 --> 11:54.720
I thought we were buds!

11:56.000 --> 11:58.670
Let me handle it for ya!

11:58.670 --> 11:59.180
Mitsuhashi?

11:59.180 --> 12:00.960
In return...

12:00.960 --> 12:03.640
Can you write down your name and number?

12:04.500 --> 12:06.190
Come on, just do it! Here.

12:08.760 --> 12:11.480
I hope this won't come back to haunt me.

12:10.720 --> 12:11.480
Tanigawa!

12:12.260 --> 12:13.760
We're friends, right?

12:13.760 --> 12:16.020
I'm there for you whenever you got troubles.

12:16.020 --> 12:18.200
Come to me for anything, okay?

12:19.020 --> 12:21.610
M... Mitsuhashi...

12:21.610 --> 12:24.160
He's a lot different from Imai.

12:26.120 --> 12:28.080
Look.

12:28.080 --> 12:30.860
Is that right? Forgive me.

12:30.860 --> 12:32.050
Hey, boy!

12:36.700 --> 12:38.280
What is it, Tanigawa?

12:38.280 --> 12:39.750
That's them,

12:39.750 --> 12:41.720
the knuckleheads I've been talking about.

12:41.730 --> 12:43.790
Glad we found him.

12:43.790 --> 12:46.440
Why don't we get today's toll from him?

12:54.570 --> 12:57.520
Th... That blonde hair...

12:57.520 --> 12:58.700
That's Nanyou's...

12:58.700 --> 12:59.530
...Mitsuhashi.

12:59.530 --> 13:02.990
Assholes! So I hear you've
been fucking with this guy.

13:03.690 --> 13:05.820
You have any idea who this is?

13:05.820 --> 13:10.710
This guy right here is the shadow boss of Beni High, Tanigawa!

13:11.990 --> 13:15.120
Calling him up was a punk move, kid!

13:15.120 --> 13:18.040
Shithead! You're the punks around here!

13:18.040 --> 13:20.210
You gang up on him four against one.

13:20.210 --> 13:22.140
Do you bitches have any idea

13:22.140 --> 13:25.630
the trouble you're causing ordinary
citizens by playing grabass over there?

13:25.630 --> 13:28.090
Yes, that's right!

13:28.090 --> 13:29.840
He sure has his way with fighting words.

13:29.840 --> 13:32.360
Unlike Imai.

13:32.360 --> 13:35.320
If you wanna fight for his money, do it one-on-one!

13:35.320 --> 13:37.510
Yes! Yes!

13:37.510 --> 13:38.280
One-on-one?

13:38.280 --> 13:40.390
Fine, we'll do it one-on-one.

13:40.390 --> 13:41.490
You're goddamn right!

13:42.190 --> 13:45.940
That's the only way real, honest men fight!

13:45.940 --> 13:47.320
Hey, wait a second!

13:47.320 --> 13:48.980
One-on-one... with me?

13:48.980 --> 13:50.190
Relax.

13:50.190 --> 13:52.110
If you take out just one of them,

13:52.110 --> 13:54.000
they'll haul ass from your hood.

13:54.000 --> 13:54.960
Okay!

13:55.660 --> 13:57.200
I'll take you on!

13:57.200 --> 13:58.720
Go get 'im, Tanigawa!

14:24.520 --> 14:31.420
Tanigawa's Chances of Winning

14:25.440 --> 14:27.480
No chance of winning.

14:27.480 --> 14:30.440
Hospitalization certain. Recovery: five months.

14:32.860 --> 14:35.360
Tanigawa! Make quick work of him!

14:35.360 --> 14:36.320
Make it quick!

14:36.320 --> 14:37.380
That bastard...

14:37.380 --> 14:40.340
Not that I care, but your boy's shaking.

14:40.830 --> 14:45.080
Screw it. I'll just make sure I get knocked down with one punch.

14:45.080 --> 14:48.060
Yo, asshole! You fittin' for a world of hurt if you fuck with me!

14:48.060 --> 14:49.060
Try it, punk!

14:50.840 --> 14:52.480
Oh my, that was fast.

14:53.470 --> 14:55.940
Hey! Tanigawa, what's wrong with you?

14:55.940 --> 14:57.470
Quit being so dramatic!

14:57.470 --> 14:58.780
It'll just amuse those guys!

14:58.780 --> 15:00.970
What the hell, you moron! Stop it!

15:00.970 --> 15:02.530
Just leave me alone!

15:04.350 --> 15:05.980
Any more objections?

15:05.980 --> 15:07.160
Nope, this ain't over!

15:07.660 --> 15:09.610
Justice will triumph!

15:09.610 --> 15:10.620
Now come and get some!

15:11.860 --> 15:12.940
You prick...

15:12.940 --> 15:14.830
Test me and I'll go apeshit on you!

15:15.360 --> 15:17.300
Then do it like the fucking ape you are!

15:17.300 --> 15:20.530
Goddammit... I've had it with your shit!

15:20.530 --> 15:21.760
Tanigawa Punch!

15:23.040 --> 15:24.910
Whoopsies...

15:24.910 --> 15:27.080
He didn't have enough reach.

15:28.750 --> 15:31.560
You only got those long arms 'cause you're a big ape!

15:33.060 --> 15:33.900
Fuck you, asshole!

15:34.460 --> 15:35.190
Oh!

15:35.190 --> 15:36.060
Here!

15:36.060 --> 15:36.810
Oopsies!

15:36.810 --> 15:39.190
Dammit! Tanigawa Head Butt!

15:46.100 --> 15:49.240
This is what happens when you fuck with the mighty Tanigawa.

15:49.240 --> 15:51.610
A... Arai!

15:51.610 --> 15:52.710
That's low, you punk!

15:53.360 --> 15:56.790
Tanigawa Giant Swing!

15:56.790 --> 15:58.340
Tanigawa Crush!

15:58.340 --> 16:00.050
Tanigawa Body Attack!

16:00.050 --> 16:01.550
Tanigawa Yo-yo!

16:03.720 --> 16:05.950
Now's your turn!

16:05.950 --> 16:07.870
Write down your name and number!

16:07.870 --> 16:10.380
Come on, move it, dammit!

16:10.380 --> 16:12.590
Can't you fucking write it neater!

16:14.330 --> 16:14.490
WAS TRUSTING MITSUHASHI THE RIGHT THING TO DO?

16:19.940 --> 16:21.480
HELL
NO!!

16:21.480 --> 16:21.530
Ginza

16:21.480 --> 16:21.530
Shopping

16:21.480 --> 16:21.530
District

16:24.450 --> 16:25.930
Here, Mitsuhashi.

16:25.930 --> 16:26.780
Thanks!

16:26.780 --> 16:28.100
Excuse us!

16:28.100 --> 16:29.060
Thanks a lot!

16:36.480 --> 16:39.780
It looks like he's trying to get a whole bunch of names and numbers.

16:39.780 --> 16:42.070
What on earth is he thinking?

16:44.120 --> 16:46.840
Don't you get it?

16:47.500 --> 16:51.210
That fool's finally figured out he doesn't have any friends.

16:51.210 --> 16:54.840
So he's busting his poor, lonely ass making a bunch of fake friends.

16:54.840 --> 16:57.420
Ah, I see now!

16:57.420 --> 16:59.270
Oh! If he comes and asks me...

16:59.800 --> 17:03.680
Imai! Can you write down your name and number?

17:03.680 --> 17:04.860
Hell no!

17:05.430 --> 17:07.320
You ain't no buddy of mine!

17:07.560 --> 17:07.690
SHOCK

17:09.430 --> 17:11.530
Howja like <i>them apples? Go fuck yourself!</i>

17:14.110 --> 17:16.360
Nice, Imai!

17:16.360 --> 17:19.860
I can picture his shocked expression right now!

17:20.490 --> 17:23.200
Imai, this is your chance to get revenge for his crap!

17:23.200 --> 17:26.700
Tanigawa, I can't control my emotions!

17:26.700 --> 17:28.160
I-Imai!

17:29.540 --> 17:30.680
All right, I'm going in.

17:31.370 --> 17:32.510
Imai, make it happen!

18:01.690 --> 18:02.490
Ow!

18:07.330 --> 18:09.340
Gosh, I am so bored.

18:13.210 --> 18:17.250
Here's Imai! Here's Imai!

18:17.920 --> 18:19.140
Here's Imai Katsutoshi!

18:21.800 --> 18:23.060
I'm Imai! Believe it!

18:24.970 --> 18:25.400
Oh!

18:26.050 --> 18:27.610
Mitsuhashi, you want something?

18:28.140 --> 18:29.260
Lucky me!

18:29.260 --> 18:30.220
Hey!

18:31.220 --> 18:34.190
Sagawa! We're pals, right?

18:34.190 --> 18:36.540
Can you write down your name, address, and phone number here?

18:39.860 --> 18:42.730
Imai said he didn't cry.

18:42.730 --> 18:47.320
But I know I saw the tears flowing down his back.

18:48.240 --> 18:48.360
IS IT A GOOD IDEA TO DEAL WITH MITSUHASHI IN ANY WAY?

18:53.490 --> 18:55.010
HELL
NO!!

19:00.090 --> 19:01.750
You're having a party at your house?

19:01.750 --> 19:02.600
What's the occasion?

19:03.720 --> 19:05.340
It all started with this.

19:07.180 --> 19:08.680
How did you get that bruise?!

19:08.680 --> 19:13.140
I was doing a little window shopping after school yesterday.

19:17.560 --> 19:18.730
You alone, babe?

19:18.730 --> 19:19.360
No.

19:19.360 --> 19:21.570
You're not waiting for a guy, are you?

19:21.570 --> 19:22.930
Yes, I am.

19:22.930 --> 19:25.920
Nah, you look free to me. Come kick it with us.

19:26.780 --> 19:29.160
Don't be such a damn ice queen!

19:29.160 --> 19:31.880
You think you're too fucking hot for us, huh?

19:32.910 --> 19:35.850
You're bothering me. Can you stop?

19:35.850 --> 19:37.640
Nope, we're just getting started!

19:39.460 --> 19:40.430
Ow...

19:41.000 --> 19:44.010
Don't act like you don't got time for us, babe.

19:44.010 --> 19:46.400
We're just a coupla guys looking for some action.

19:46.400 --> 19:48.210
Come on, we're going.

19:49.570 --> 19:50.360
Hey, get back here!

19:51.860 --> 19:53.600
Kyouko, run for it!

19:53.600 --> 19:55.060
Hey, what're you doing?!

19:55.060 --> 19:56.270
What're we doing?

19:56.270 --> 19:58.940
We're making you our little date, sugar.

19:58.940 --> 20:01.080
Good God! Don't even joke about that!

20:01.080 --> 20:02.040
No, come with us.

20:11.780 --> 20:13.050
Don't fuck with us!

20:21.210 --> 20:23.290
God! How rude!

20:23.290 --> 20:25.170
Thank you, Riko! You saved me!

20:25.170 --> 20:26.440
I was so scared!

20:27.050 --> 20:30.760
I don't know what I'd do if Riko hadn't arrived.

20:30.760 --> 20:32.300
That <i>was a close one.</i>

20:32.300 --> 20:35.400
My mom saw this bruise when I came home.

20:35.400 --> 20:37.450
Kyouko, what happened to your forehead?

20:38.120 --> 20:39.870
You weren't fighting, were you?

20:40.520 --> 20:42.860
No, just ran into some hoodlums.

20:42.860 --> 20:45.280
What kind of friends are you associating with?

20:45.280 --> 20:47.360
And you say you also have a boyfriend?

20:47.360 --> 20:48.360
What's he like?

20:48.360 --> 20:50.420
Well, he's a normal boy.

20:51.030 --> 20:54.580
Is he the type of boy you can't introduce to us?

20:54.580 --> 20:55.830
Of course I can!

20:55.830 --> 20:57.870
Then bring him here so we can meet him!

20:57.870 --> 21:01.680
Yes. As your father, I would like to see this boyfriend of yours.

21:01.680 --> 21:03.540
Yeah, but...

21:03.540 --> 21:05.270
I know, let's have a party!

21:06.000 --> 21:08.170
Call your friends over for a party.

21:08.170 --> 21:09.420
That's a fine idea.

21:09.420 --> 21:12.510
That way we get to know the type of people you're accompanying.

21:12.510 --> 21:14.030
Let's do that, okay?

21:14.600 --> 21:16.140
That's what they said.

21:16.140 --> 21:18.850
They're totally into the whole idea.

21:19.520 --> 21:21.580
Really? That's a tough one.

21:22.770 --> 21:25.370
At least I know they'll never go for my 'do.

21:26.570 --> 21:29.690
My parents would probably faint if they saw it.

21:30.630 --> 21:32.910
This is no laughing matter, Kyou.

21:32.910 --> 21:37.040
Well, I think I can get by with a wig or something.

21:37.820 --> 21:40.090
Crap! Are you inviting Mitsuhashi too?

21:40.580 --> 21:41.330
Why not?

21:41.330 --> 21:43.330
Do <i>not invite that dude!</i>

21:43.330 --> 21:44.750
You know I can't do that.

21:44.750 --> 21:45.920
Just don't!

21:45.920 --> 21:48.920
He'll only ruin everything, so don't invite him!

21:48.920 --> 21:50.930
But he'll know what we did to him.

21:54.260 --> 21:58.140
That guy <i>does have a way of picking up on these things.</i>

21:58.140 --> 22:00.140
If we don't invite him, he'll...

22:00.140 --> 22:02.280
Argh, I got a migraine!

22:02.770 --> 22:06.000
Don't worry, we'll deal with it when it happens, okay?

22:12.860 --> 22:15.240
Shikibe

22:12.860 --> 22:15.240
Hideyuki

22:12.860 --> 22:15.240
Ogata Yasunori

22:12.860 --> 22:15.240
Akasaka Riko

22:15.820 --> 22:17.240
Okay, are we good?

22:17.840 --> 22:19.580
Thank you, thank you!

22:19.580 --> 22:21.370
I filled out a lot of pages.

22:22.210 --> 22:25.540
This should shut up that woman my dad married.

22:25.540 --> 22:26.710
Hey!

22:26.710 --> 22:27.270
Good morning!

22:27.840 --> 22:29.800
Oh, there's another one!

22:29.800 --> 22:30.730
Itou, good morning!

22:31.760 --> 22:36.050
Say, can you write down your name and number here? Please?

22:40.180 --> 22:41.280
On one condition.

22:41.810 --> 22:42.780
What's that?

22:49.320 --> 22:50.780
A party at Kyou's house?

22:50.780 --> 22:51.080
Yeah.

22:52.150 --> 22:55.660
If you behave yourself, I'll write down my info.

22:55.660 --> 22:58.080
Really? Is that all?

22:58.550 --> 23:04.460
All I gotta do is convince her parents that she has straight-laced friends?

23:04.460 --> 23:06.000
Y-Yeah.

23:06.000 --> 23:08.290
<i>That guy can<i> pick up on things.</i></i>

23:08.290 --> 23:14.510
Itou, you think I'm the type of guy who'll
wreck what my good friend has with Kyou?

23:14.510 --> 23:18.090
I'm still capable of conducting
myself when it counts, you know.

23:18.090 --> 23:19.150
You can trust me.

23:19.640 --> 23:21.270
M-Mitsuhashi!

23:22.860 --> 23:24.200
Now, if you may.

23:24.200 --> 23:25.560
Right.

23:25.560 --> 23:27.980
A lot of people must come to those parties.

23:27.980 --> 23:32.650
If I'm gonna get names from all of them, one address book won't be enough.

23:35.360 --> 23:36.900
Wh-What the hell?

23:36.900 --> 23:39.070
You'll have it <i>after you keep your promise.</i>

23:39.070 --> 23:39.710
No fair!

23:44.040 --> 23:46.930
Three, what's that you're wearing?

23:46.930 --> 23:48.810
Are you going to play a trumpet too?

23:48.810 --> 23:50.540
You think it's that bad?

23:50.540 --> 23:52.510
And these are my <i>nice clothes!</i>

23:53.340 --> 23:57.130
Are we clear? Absolutely no funny stuff today, Three.

23:57.130 --> 23:58.970
We're doing this for Itou and Kyouko!

23:58.970 --> 24:01.720
Can it, Christ! Don't you even trust me?

24:01.720 --> 24:02.560
No, I don't!

24:02.560 --> 24:04.640
I'm here.

24:13.440 --> 24:16.000
Sorry I'm late. I'm not used to wearing these.

24:17.570 --> 24:20.030
So <i>this is Itou?</i>

24:20.030 --> 24:21.090
I think so.

24:23.680 --> 24:27.580
I-Itou! You doing a fucking kiddie festival?

24:27.580 --> 24:28.620
You're killing me!

24:29.430 --> 24:33.140
You, of all people, have no right to say that, Mitsuhashi.

24:33.140 --> 24:34.550
I'm dying!

24:41.570 --> 24:43.470
This place is huge.

24:43.470 --> 24:44.930
It must be 592 square yards.

24:44.930 --> 24:47.020
If it's 253,000 yen per square yard...

24:47.020 --> 24:49.270
Mitsuhashi, don't forget your promise.

24:49.270 --> 24:51.730
Relax, just press the doorbell.

24:56.780 --> 24:57.370
Coming!

24:58.860 --> 25:01.490
Come in! Everyone's here!

25:01.490 --> 25:02.340
Welcome!

25:02.340 --> 25:07.370
U-Uh, we thank you! F-For inviting us.

25:07.370 --> 25:08.410
W-We truly...

25:08.410 --> 25:09.620
Geez!

25:09.620 --> 25:12.080
Sorry for coming late.

25:12.080 --> 25:13.500
Here. I know this isn't much.

25:13.500 --> 25:14.680
Oh my! Are those for me?

25:15.670 --> 25:18.900
I was unable to find flowers prettier than you, ma'am.

25:18.900 --> 25:21.130
My, such eloquence!

25:21.130 --> 25:23.800
Forgive me for being brutally honest.

25:23.800 --> 25:25.930
We thank you for looking after Kyouko.

25:25.930 --> 25:27.860
Please come this way.

25:27.860 --> 25:30.120
Okay, if you'll excuse me.

25:42.570 --> 25:45.030
Take a seat. We'll come back shortly.

25:46.330 --> 25:47.580
These look great!

25:47.580 --> 25:48.220
Three!

25:49.790 --> 25:51.160
Okay.

25:51.160 --> 25:51.780
Huh?

25:52.430 --> 25:57.350
My dad loves eating those crunchy beaks you find in abalones.

25:57.920 --> 26:00.050
What's Imai doing here?

26:00.050 --> 26:01.590
Who's that next to him?

26:01.590 --> 26:05.220
That's Misako, that pen pal of his.

26:05.220 --> 26:06.720
Misako?

26:16.650 --> 26:18.770
Oh, now I remember!

26:18.770 --> 26:21.440
Kyouko made sure to invite both of them over.

26:21.440 --> 26:22.990
This is gonna be classic.

26:22.990 --> 26:24.750
No, don't you dare try anything!

26:28.200 --> 26:30.180
That dick, thinks he's in charge.

26:31.830 --> 26:33.210
Imai?

26:33.210 --> 26:34.140
Uh, yes?

26:34.140 --> 26:35.330
Here.

26:35.330 --> 26:36.920
Oh, thanks.

26:36.920 --> 26:40.300
It's an honor having you fill my glass...

26:40.300 --> 26:41.510
Oops! Oops!

26:41.510 --> 26:45.300
Just kidding! I was pretending it was sake.

26:45.300 --> 26:47.760
A sake drinker is just like a flower bud.

26:47.760 --> 26:50.950
They both yell "Sake! Sake!" morning, noon, and night.

26:50.950 --> 26:52.770
What is he saying?

26:52.770 --> 26:54.810
He's just being bashful.

26:54.810 --> 26:55.910
How cute.

26:58.360 --> 27:00.070
I'm a lucky man.

27:00.070 --> 27:03.200
Who'd believe this was how I'd reunite with Misako?

27:13.010 --> 27:14.470
What's wrong, Imai?

27:26.300 --> 27:28.930
Hi, it's been a while, Misako.

27:29.970 --> 27:31.260
Have you forgotten me?

27:31.260 --> 27:34.200
My name is Mitsuhashi. I worked in that café.

27:34.200 --> 27:37.480
A café? Mitsuhashi?

27:41.230 --> 27:44.030
Hey, I didn't order this.

27:45.700 --> 27:48.660
This is our apology for my earlier conduct.

27:48.660 --> 27:51.470
I had no idea you knew Mitsuhashi.

27:52.030 --> 27:55.330
Mitsuhashi told me to serve these to you two.

27:55.330 --> 27:56.050
Good luck!

28:00.880 --> 28:02.380
Oh, now I remember!

28:02.380 --> 28:04.340
Thanks for that parfait!

28:05.230 --> 28:07.300
If it's all right with you, uh...

28:07.300 --> 28:10.590
I'd be happy to have your number.

28:10.590 --> 28:11.190
Oh, sure.

28:11.680 --> 28:13.060
God, Three!

28:13.060 --> 28:14.570
Hey, pipe down, dammit!

28:15.640 --> 28:17.890
You ain't the only people here, you know!

28:17.890 --> 28:20.400
You mopes gotta be more refined!

28:20.400 --> 28:22.110
Stop that!

28:22.110 --> 28:23.770
Let me introduce us. We're—

28:23.770 --> 28:27.190
I see Kyouko's tight with a bunch of dweebs.

28:27.190 --> 28:28.740
I said stop it!

28:28.740 --> 28:30.030
You better let it go.

28:30.030 --> 28:33.030
You got no chance against them.

28:33.030 --> 28:34.120
What's that, bitch?

28:34.120 --> 28:35.930
You saying that chimp's better than me?

28:35.930 --> 28:37.120
You motherf...

28:37.120 --> 28:38.040
Here we are!

28:38.040 --> 28:38.930
Great!

28:44.490 --> 28:44.530
Kyouko Age 10

28:44.490 --> 28:44.530
Age 5

28:45.020 --> 28:47.180
Wow, she's cute!

28:47.180 --> 28:49.450
So Kyouko's always been a cutie.

28:49.230 --> 28:52.930
She used to like birds and
flowers when she was little.

28:52.930 --> 28:54.890
She <i>is a gentle soul.</i>

28:54.890 --> 28:57.030
Actually, I'm an avid birdwatcher myself.

28:57.030 --> 29:00.310
This has become Mitsuhashi's one-man show.

29:00.310 --> 29:02.400
I think it's great he's not causing trouble.

29:02.400 --> 29:04.110
You got a point...

29:04.110 --> 29:05.500
I'm using the bathroom.

29:06.110 --> 29:07.330
It's all done.

29:07.860 --> 29:09.200
Can you bring this in?

29:09.200 --> 29:09.950
Sure.

29:09.950 --> 29:11.280
So, Kyouko...

29:11.280 --> 29:12.160
What is it?

29:12.160 --> 29:14.880
That Mitsuhashi is a nice boy.

29:14.880 --> 29:16.580
You have my approval.

29:16.580 --> 29:18.840
W-Wait, you're making a mistake!

29:18.290 --> 29:20.120
Don't worry about it!

29:23.380 --> 29:26.960
I was also thinking I should learn plant names.

29:26.960 --> 29:29.090
Oh! Now that there's a good hobby!

29:29.090 --> 29:31.010
You gotta love nature.

29:31.010 --> 29:32.800
I wholeheartedly agree.

29:32.800 --> 29:34.170
M-Misako?

29:34.170 --> 29:34.480
Yes?

29:35.760 --> 29:39.450
I'm sorry that <i>moron Mitsuhashi is always bothering you.</i>

29:39.450 --> 29:42.410
It's completely the opposite. I think he's a great guy.

29:42.740 --> 29:44.200
What?

29:45.870 --> 29:50.830
Misako... Misako... fell for Mitsuhashi's wiles!

29:45.870 --> 29:48.940
We sure share the same tastes.

29:48.940 --> 29:50.830
Yeah, can't deny that.

29:50.830 --> 29:54.760
Misako will become another one of his human sacrifices!

29:54.760 --> 29:56.210
D-Don't, Misako!

29:56.210 --> 30:00.010
I-I will save you from his clutches!

30:00.010 --> 30:01.470
M-Misako!

30:14.720 --> 30:15.610
Hell yeah!

30:25.560 --> 30:26.330
Imai?

30:26.330 --> 30:27.410
Shut up!

30:28.820 --> 30:31.070
I toldja you ain't the only fuggin' guests here!

30:31.070 --> 30:31.580
Stop this!

30:32.320 --> 30:35.910
We've been keeping to ourselves the whole time, yet you assholes...

30:35.910 --> 30:37.460
Don't fucking make trouble for Kyouko!

30:37.460 --> 30:39.170
<i>You</i> can start by being quiet!

30:39.700 --> 30:41.130
Don't you lecture me!

30:41.620 --> 30:42.640
Hey!

30:42.640 --> 30:43.800
Enough of that!

30:44.370 --> 30:46.080
The fuck's your problem, nerd?

30:46.080 --> 30:47.770
You're not supposed to hit a girl!

30:47.770 --> 30:51.480
What's that? You wanna throw down, punk?!

30:52.260 --> 30:53.630
Please, let it go.

30:54.440 --> 30:57.150
What? Lost your balls, nerd?

30:58.360 --> 30:59.650
Bastard!

30:59.650 --> 31:01.110
Oh no!

31:01.110 --> 31:04.230
Sorry, my hand slipped.

31:05.390 --> 31:06.830
What the f—

31:06.830 --> 31:09.360
Sorry! My hand slipped!

31:09.360 --> 31:10.040
Three, quit it!

31:10.650 --> 31:11.900
What's wrong?

31:12.980 --> 31:15.130
You asshat... you better cut your shit!

31:15.720 --> 31:16.710
Fuck you!

31:17.360 --> 31:19.990
I've had it up to <i>here with your shit!</i>

31:21.740 --> 31:22.720
He's blond!

31:26.140 --> 31:29.400
See? I told you to let it go.

31:29.400 --> 31:30.560
Go to hell!

31:30.560 --> 31:31.730
Think fast!

32:06.210 --> 32:08.420
Huh? What's going on? Eh?

32:16.580 --> 32:17.480
I'm Audi!

32:23.220 --> 32:26.020
It's... all over!

32:26.020 --> 32:26.570
Itou!

32:26.570 --> 32:30.230
Stay with me! Itou! Itou!

32:37.390 --> 32:37.550
WAS TRUSTING MITSUHASHI THE RIGHT THING TO DO?

32:43.020 --> 32:45.020
HELL
NO!!

33:08.060 --> 33:10.830
What are you doing hiding there?

33:14.020 --> 33:16.190
Itou... I'm sorry.

33:18.240 --> 33:20.570
Forget about it. There's nothing we can do.

33:23.620 --> 33:27.410
Keep your promise and write down your name and number.

33:31.080 --> 33:34.470
Mitsuhashi... you're un-fucking-believable!

33:39.010 --> 33:40.510
Wait, Itou! I get how you're feeling!

33:40.510 --> 33:43.780
Eat shit! You ain't no fucking friend of mine!

33:44.470 --> 33:45.810
Wait!

33:51.850 --> 33:53.100
Imai.

33:53.100 --> 33:55.770
Tanigawa, don't say a word.

33:55.770 --> 33:58.940
There are even some proverbs:

33:58.940 --> 34:03.180
"Speak ill and the autumn winds will chill your lips."

34:03.180 --> 34:05.780
"I cry bitter tears while
cavorting with a dumbass."

34:05.780 --> 34:07.660
"Dumbass"?

34:07.660 --> 34:09.570
What? What is it?

34:09.700 --> 34:10.390
Eh?

34:10.890 --> 34:11.890
Kyouko?

34:11.910 --> 34:16.420
I'll ask you once again, is your boyfriend <i>really Itou?</i>

34:16.420 --> 34:17.710
Mm-hmm.

34:17.710 --> 34:19.340
And <i>not Mitsuhashi?</i>

34:19.340 --> 34:20.010
Yes.

34:20.010 --> 34:22.510
Thank God it's not that blond boy, Mitsuhashi!

34:22.510 --> 34:25.110
Yes! Thank goodness it's Itou!

34:25.110 --> 34:27.220
Yes, thank God!

34:27.020 --> 34:28.080
Thank the stars!

34:27.220 --> 34:28.810
I'm very pleased!

34:28.810 --> 34:30.070
Thanks heavens!

34:30.560 --> 34:33.940
Ma! Did you see my address book?

34:33.940 --> 34:35.350
Address book?

34:35.350 --> 34:37.980
I accidentally washed it with your shirts!

34:37.980 --> 34:38.580
What?

34:39.310 --> 34:43.450
I keep telling you not to leave things in the pockets!

34:43.450 --> 34:45.910
God no!

34:52.150 --> 34:52.190
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

34:52.150 --> 34:52.190
Starting  today,  I'll!!

34:55.530 --> 34:58.030
Operation: Best Buds

34:59.640 --> 35:01.750
Let's worry about the future tomorrow.

35:01.750 --> 35:04.570
When tomorrow comes, it'll all work out.

35:07.750 --> 35:09.790
If it doesn't work out, I'll just run away.

35:09.790 --> 35:12.230
If I'm found, I'll make up an excuse.

35:15.750 --> 35:17.770
You and me are friends, partner.

35:17.770 --> 35:19.750
If the going gets tough, the tough say goodbye.

35:23.710 --> 35:25.790
I help you.

35:24.630 --> 35:25.790
We're family.

35:25.790 --> 35:27.750
I like you.

35:39.740 --> 35:41.710
On stressful days, I'll hit you.

35:41.710 --> 35:44.730
Then, I'll say, "I'm sorry," and you'll forgive me.

35:47.620 --> 35:49.160
That cute girl is mine,

35:49.160 --> 35:52.320
but I belong to no one.

35:55.690 --> 35:57.710
We're all brothers and sisters in this world.

35:57.710 --> 35:59.700
When the going gets tough, the tough kick and scream.

37:01.230 --> 37:02.530
See you next time!
